    <data key="d0">Auction.com Near Real-Time Analytics Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=irpARK1Tdo4</data>
    <data key="d2">Transitioned from nightly batch processing to near real-time querying for business analysts and data scientists using Athena and S3.</data>
    <data key="d3">Analytics, Data Ingestion, ETL</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
